CHAPTER.VERS:
And Ram begat Amminadab; and Amminadab begat Nahshon, 

          That is, chief of the family.
         prince of the children of Judah;

And the sons of Appaim; Ishi. And the sons of Ishi; Sheshan. And the children of Sheshan; 

          Who died while his father was alive, and therefore it is said in (1Ch_2:34) that Sheshan had no sons.
         Ahlai.
